  "visualBrief": "Dated2008–2016Castro Theatre, with2022exterior arcade layout: broad native concrete front/narrow rear auditorium/shallow roof, three-part white/buff Spanish Colonial facade with tall arched gridded light, scroll parapet/shell niche/oval/relief cartouches/abstract foliage, small flanking windows/balconies and blind pink panels. Native trapezoid1937marquee with red-gold-blue zigzags/hexagons/curved CASTROcrest/static pale boards and bulb soffit. Red double-sided CASTROblade, white channel letters/gold tube strokes/blue edge scrolls/crown/diamond, open attachment brackets. Deep tiled arcade, five glazed oak door pairs/three plain northwall poster recesses/faceted island booth; same-building shop glazing/blue north and dark south awnings. Sloping frontage/unchanged terrain, no neighboring structures or actual ads/artwork/interior.",
